 base is found at review time.\n\nRequested next: `ard:triage:engineer`\nOutput: [.ard/332/triage-lead.md](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/blob/ab3842d4159aa21dc2a97d126b196b20ad6eb80a/.ard/332/triage-lead.md) · log [.ard/332/logs/triage-lead-20261124T174128.355Z.log](https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard/blob/ab3842d4159aa21dc2a97d126b196b20ad6eb80a/.ard/332/logs/triage-lead-20261124T174128.355Z.log) · job `01M87ABXKQXD7EYDSS4SNCJ6RE` · attempt 1\n\n\n.ard:\n138\n142\n157\n158\n159\n160\n161\n165\n168\n174\n178\n184\n194\n203\n204\n205\n212\n213\n215\n216\n217\n221\n222\n223\n224\n227\n231\n236\n237","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01PhyeLzsqZV2t8H9eBUPFXU","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
